<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Pirelli holding SIP H1 net up.</title>
<headline>Swiss Pirelli holding SIP H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p>Holding share of Pirelli SpA</p>
<p>  net profit		    69.2		vs 31.2</p>
<p> Holding net profit	   74.4		vs 24.7</p>
<p> Net debt			 3.4		 vs N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Societe Internationale Pirelli SpA (SIP) is a financial holding company based in Switzerland with a controlling stake in Italian tyre and cable maker Pirelli SpA, which announced its half year results earlier on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
